<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Awaiting approval · HAB Academy</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-wrap">
<div class="auth-card">
  <div class="brand-stack">
    <div class="shield">HAB</div>
    <div class="name">Almost In</div>
    <div class="sub">HAB ACADEMY · AWAITING APPROVAL</div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert info">
    Your <strong><%= roleChoice === 'coach' ? 'coach' : 'co-owner' %></strong> request for
    <strong><%= shopName %></strong> is in. The shop owner needs to approve it from their dashboard
    before you can sign in as <strong><%= email %></strong>.
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft);">
    Give your owner a heads-up, then come back and <a href="/login">sign in</a> once they've approved you.
    Your password is already set.
  </p>

  <div class="tagline">Do what's Right · Do what's Fair · Do Your Best.</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
